        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Manning Marius Kimmel, Husband E. Kimmel\n- Roles: United States Navy submarine officer, Admiral\n- Organizations: United States Navy\n- Events: World War II, retirement\n\nFacts:\n- Manning Marius Kimmel was born on April 22, 1913.\n- Manning Marius Kimmel was the son of Admiral Husband E. Kimmel.\n- Manning Marius Kimmel served as a United States Navy submarine officer during World War II.\n- Husband E. Kimmel retired from the United States Navy in early 1942.\n- Manning Marius Kimmel died on or around July 26, 1944.",
